       "Consider consent and whether seeking it would increase risk to the child",
       "Telephone the MASH / children's social care for urgent cases to discuss and refer",
       "Confirm the referral in writing on the local form, within the timescale set by your local procedure (commonly 24 to 48 hours)",
       "Record the decision, your rationale and the reference number, and agree how feedback will come back",
