    "a": 1,
    "fb": "A non-acute but deteriorating neglect picture with achievable consent fits early help — coordinate support and be ready to escalate to s17/s47 if it worsens. s47 is disproportionate with no evidence of significant harm, and monitoring or signposting alone is drift."
