      "k": "callout",
      "tone": "tip",
      "title": "Model it yourself",
      "t": "Children learn emotional skills by watching adults. Naming your own feelings calmly ('I found that a bit tricky, so I took a breath') and staying regulated under pressure teaches more than any poster."
